atchers":15335,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"## Describe the bug\r\nWhen running my (Pico)CLI app (https://github.com/gunnarmorling/kc-cli) in Dev mode, it doesn't show me the options for restarting that CLI app, editing the passed parameters, etc. It just hangs there:\r\n\r\n```\r\nmvn compile quarkus:dev  -Dquarkus.args='info'\r\n\r\n...\r\n\r\nQuarkus application exited with code 0\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\nThere should be the line telling me about the dev mode options like restarting, etc.\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\nThat line isn't displayed.\r\n\r\n## To Reproduce\r\n\r\nClone the project and run it in dev mode.\r\n\r\n### Configuration\r\nn.a.\r\n\r\n### Screenshots\r\nn.a.\r\n\r\n## Environment (please complete the following information):\r\n\r\n### Output of `uname -a` or `ver`\r\nDarwin Kernel Version 19.6.0\r\n\r\n### Output of `java -version`\r\nbuild 17-ea+23-2064\r\n\r\n### GraalVM version (if different from Java)\r\n21.1.0\r\n\r\n### Quarkus version or git rev\r\n2.0.0\r\n\r\n### Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`)\r\nMaven 3.8.1\r\n\r\n## Additional context\r\nn.a.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/18594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/18594/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":5022800369,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDUwMjI4MDAzNjk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/5022800369","actor":{"login":"stuartwdouglas","id":328571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODU3MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/328571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas","html_url":"https://github.com/stuar